 "_KEYWORDS_README": "Ordered rules applied to (a) search-engine queries and (b) page title + URL path when the domain map misses. First match wins. This is how 'a search for kubernetes' becomes NEDO work and 'a search for blood sugar' becomes personal health. Extend freely.",
