 "_MASTER_README": "Controlled MASTER vocabulary (report-item level). Work-NEDO: NEDO\u00b7Cluster, NEDO\u00b7K8s-Components, NEDO\u00b7OS, NEDO\u00b7Machine-Bringup, NEDO\u00b7Networking. Work non-NEDO: Izuma\u00b7Business, Izuma\u00b7USGOV, Izuma\u00b7Corp, Gravhl, tmctech. Personal: Personal\u00b7{Health,House,Cars,Kids,Travel,Finance,Entertainment,Genealogy,Shopping,Education,Misc}. Every projects/domains/keywords entry carries an explicit `master`; classify.py reads it and prints `MASTER | company \u2014 sub` per line."
